  {
   "id": "the-centennial-case-a-shijima-story-191420@major-2022-08-09",
   "gameId": "the-centennial-case-a-shijima-story-191420",
   "displayName": "Contents of the Second Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-08-09T16:13:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Adjusted part of the “Rules for Reasoning”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Changed “Suspend” to “Save”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Improved the explanation in the tutorial about moving “Clues”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Improved the content of the notes in Chapter 5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "● Added the following features to Options",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・ Feature allowing cursor movement (both free and investigation) controls when using a gamepad to be set to either to left or right stick.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Feature allowing adjustment of cursor movement speed (both free and investigation).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Feature that toggles the Pattern Guide on “Clues” and “Mysteries”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Adjusted and improved the following areas in the Cognitive Reasoning Space.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Enlarged the valid area, making it easier to fit “Clues”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Made it so the path can be moved whilst holding a “Clue”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Made improvements to allow you to skip through line-by-line when viewing “Hypotheses”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Made improvements to allow you to skip the whole summary conversation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Changed so that “Clues” can be connected from any point when connecting several “Clues” on the path.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "● ! on the title screen. Fixed a bug that prevented the exclamation mark from disappearing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a bug that, under certain conditions, caused the video to stop before moving onto a question.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Corrections of errors in the Korean text, and in the text and video for other languages.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Other minor bug fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
